<title>BRAZIL: Brazil intervenes in Bamerindus bank.</title>
<headline>Brazil intervenes in Bamerindus bank.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank placed troubled private banking group Bamerindus under federal administration on Wednesday because of growing financial difficulties, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said in a statement that the decision was motivated &quot;by the growing difficulties the group has been facing for some time.&quot;</p>
</text>
